cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "8DOF WheelLeg RL: an open reinforcement-learning stack for an 8-DOF wheel-legged robot"
abstract: >-
  Reinforcement-learning training stack for an 8-DOF two-wheel-legged robot: URDF to MJCF
  conversion, an mjlab + MuJoCo Warp pipeline (200 Hz physics, 50 Hz policy), PPO with a
  staged curriculum over balance, velocity tracking, slopes, rough terrain, stairs and fall
  recovery, domain randomisation, and W&B logging.
